    "body": "This will print multiple `*`-characters if multiple of the conditions for these characters are met. I think you want to do something like `(*$conflicted$deleted$renamed$modified$untracked)` in the above format string and set all these variable to zero-width spaces (empty strings would cause them to be ignored).",
