    "body": "It seems `242` is fairly similar to what most themes assign to `bright-black` (which is `8`), as shown here:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4658208/135533766-a05cb6ae-56a4-4d73-abc8-ea84e47a1aa5.png)\r\n\r\nWould you be open to having it changed for the values set to `242`?\r\nIt would allow for the preset to better match themes with different color schemes.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\nstyle = \"bright-black\"\r\n```",
